VALUES
('mussoorie-hills-ex-delhi-3d','Mussoorie Hills Escape · Ex Delhi','Queen of the Hills in 3 days — Mall Road, Kempty Falls, Lal Tibba sunsets and a Dhanaulti pine-forest day, by AC Tempo Traveller from Delhi.','Leave Delhi early and be on Mussoorie''s Mall Road by evening. Two nights in a 3★ hotel near Mall Road with breakfast and dinner, a full sightseeing day (Kempty Falls, Company Garden, Lal Tibba, Char Dukan, Landour) and a half-day to Dhanaulti''s Eco Park before the drive home.

## Good to know
- Travel is by shared AC Tempo Traveller with the group (max 12 guests).
- Rooms are on twin sharing; a single room costs extra.
- Snowfall in Jan–Feb can close Dhanaulti; we swap in Landour and George Everest then.
- Prices include 5% GST.',3,2,'["Delhi", "Dehradun", "Mussoorie", "Kempty Falls", "Dhanaulti"]','["mountains", "weekend", "family", "honeymoon"]','[{"dayNumber": 1, "title": "Delhi → Mussoorie", "description": "Pickup from Delhi and drive via Meerut–Roorkee–Dehradun (about 290 km, 7–8 hrs with breakfast and lunch stops). Check in and take an evening stroll on Mall Road and Camel''s Back Road.", "activityDetails": ["Pickup: 6:00 AM, Akshardham Metro (Gate 1)", "Breakfast stop on the highway (own cost)", "Hotel check-in around 2:30 PM", "Mall Road & Camel''s Back Road walk", "Dinner at hotel"], "time": "6:00 AM"}, {"dayNumber": 2, "title": "Mussoorie sightseeing", "description": "A full day around Mussoorie: Kempty Falls in the morning, then Company Garden, Gun Hill ropeway, and Landour''s Char Dukan and Lal Tibba for sunset.", "activityDetails": ["Kempty Falls (about 15 km)", "Company Garden", "Gun Hill ropeway (ticket own cost)", "Landour, Char Dukan & Lal Tibba sunset", "Breakfast & dinner at hotel"], "time": "8:30 AM"}, {"dayNumber": 3, "title": "Dhanaulti → Delhi", "description": "Morning drive to Dhanaulti''s Eco Park and the pine forests on the Chamba road, then lunch and return to Delhi by night.", "activityDetails": ["Check out after breakfast", "Dhanaulti Eco Park (entry own cost)", "Drive back via Dehradun", "Drop at Akshardham Metro around 10:00 PM"], "time": "8:00 AM"}]','[{"id": "mus-261127", "startDate": "2026-11-27", "startTime": "06:00", "endDate": "2026-11-29", "endTime": "22:00", "seats": 12, "price": null, "status": "open", "note": ""}, {"id": "mus-261211", "startDate": "2026-12-11", "startTime": "06:00", "endDate": "2026-12-13", "endTime": "22:00", "seats": 12, "price": null, "status": "open", "note": ""}, {"id": "mus-261224", "startDate": "2026-12-24", "startTime": "06:00", "endDate": "2026-12-26", "endTime": "22:00", "seats": 12, "price": 12999, "status": "open", "note": "Christmas"}, {"id": "mus-270115", "startDate": "2027-01-15", "startTime": 