('kainchi-dham-nainital-ex-delhi-3d','Kainchi Dham & Nainital · Ex Delhi','Neem Karoli Baba''s Kainchi Dham darshan with Nainital lake, Bhimtal and Naukuchiatal — 3 days by AC Tempo Traveller from Delhi.','An overnight-free 3-day trip to the Kumaon hills: Neem Karoli Baba''s ashram at Kainchi Dham, a boat ride on Naini Lake, the Mall Road and Naina Devi temple, plus the quieter lakes of Bhimtal and Naukuchiatal.

## Good to know
- Kainchi Dham is open roughly 7 AM–6 PM; phones and cameras are not allowed inside. We reach in the morning to avoid the longest queues.
- On the 15 June foundation day the ashram sees lakhs of devotees; we don''t run that date.
- Travel by shared AC Tempo Traveller (max 12 guests). Rooms on twin sharing.
- Prices include 5% GST.',3,2,'["Delhi", "Bhimtal", "Nainital", "Kainchi Dham", "Naukuchiatal"]','["pilgrimage", "mountains", "weekend", "family"]','[{"dayNumber": 1, "title": "Delhi → Nainital", "description": "Drive from Delhi via Moradabad–Haldwani to Nainital (about 310 km, 8 hrs). Evening on the Mall Road and at Naina Devi temple by the lake.", "activityDetails": ["Pickup: 5:30 AM, Akshardham Metro (Gate 1)", "Highway breakfast stop (own cost)", "Check in by 2:30 PM", "Naina Devi temple & Mall Road", "Dinner at hotel"], "time": "5:30 AM"}, {"dayNumber": 2, "title": "Kainchi Dham darshan & the lakes", "description": "Early drive to Kainchi Dham (17 km) for darshan at Neem Karoli Baba''s ashram, then Bhimtal and Naukuchiatal, ending with a boat ride on Naini Lake.", "activityDetails": ["Kainchi Dham darshan by 8:30 AM", "Bhimtal lake & island aquarium", "Naukuchiatal", "Naini Lake boating (own cost)", "Snow View Point ropeway (optional, own cost)"], "time": "7:00 AM"}, {"dayNumber": 3, "title": "Nainital → Delhi", "description": "After breakfast, a short stop at the Tiffin Top / Land''s End viewpoints (weather permitting), then the drive back to Delhi.", "activityDetails": ["Check out after breakfast", "Land''s End / Tiffin Top viewpoint", "Drop at Akshardham Metro around 9:30 PM"], "time": "8:00 AM"}]','[{"id": "kai-261120", "startDate": "2026-11-20", "startTime": "05:30", "endDate": "2026-11-22", "endTime": "21:30", "seats": 12, "price": null, "status": "open", "note": ""}, {"id": "kai-261204", "startDate": "2026-12-04", "startTime": "05:30", "endDate": "2026-12-06", "endTime": "21:30", "seats": 12, "price": null, "status": "open", "note": ""}, {"id": "kai-261218", "startDate": "2026-12-18", "startTime": "05:30", "endDate": "2026-12-20", "endTime": "21:30", "seats": 12, "price": null, "status": "open", "note": ""}, {"id": "kai-270108", "startDate": "2027-01-08", "startTime": "05:30", "endDate": "2027-01-10", "endTime": "21:30", "seats": 12, "price": null, "stat