e deducted). Train tickets, once issued, follow IRCTC refund rules and are refunded only as IRCTC refunds them. Date changes are free once if requested 15+ days before departure and seats are available on the new date. Refunds go back to the original payment method within 7–10 working days.','[{"daysBefore": 30, "deductionPct": 10}, {"daysBefore": 15, "deductionPct": 25}, {"daysBefore": 7, "deductionPct": 50}, {"daysBefore": 0, "deductionPct": 100}]','₹11,499 per person on twin sharing, ex Delhi, GST included. April departure ₹12,499. Single room +₹3,800. Child 5–11 without extra bed ₹7,999.','{"name": "SKYO Package Desk", "email": "support@skyo.in", "phone": "+91 90000 00000"}','published',1),
('vaishno-devi-vande-bharat-ex-delhi-4d','Mata Vaishno Devi by Vande Bharat · Ex Delhi','Delhi to Katra on the Vande Bharat Express, two days for the Bhawan yatra and Bhairon Baba, 3 nights in Katra — the easy way to Mata''s darshan.','Take the morning Vande Bharat from New Delhi to Shri Mata Vaishno Devi Katra (about 8 hrs), stay 3 nights in Katra close to the Banganga start point, and do the yatra at your own pace with a full rest day after it.

## Good to know
- The yatra is about 13 km each way from Banganga to Bhawan. Pony, palki, battery car (Adhkuwari–Bhawan) and helicopter (Katra–Sanjichhat) are available at extra cost and are booked on the Shrine Board website.
- Yatra registration (RFID card) is free and mandatory; we help you get it on arrival.
- Train: AC Chair Car on the Vande Bharat both ways. Timings follow the IRCTC schedule.
- Prices include 5% GST.',4,3,'["New Delhi", "Katra", "Bhawan", "Bhairon Ghati"]','["pilgrimage", "budget", "family"]','[{"dayNumber": 1, "title": "New Delhi → Katra by Vande Bharat", "description": "Board the morning Vande Bharat Express at New Delhi and reach Katra by afternoon. Hotel check-in, RFID yatra registration, and an evening in the Katra market.", "activityDetails": ["Report at New Delhi station (Platform as per IRCTC) by 5:30 AM", "Vande Bharat, AC Chair Car — breakfast & lunch served on board", "Arrive Katra around 2:00 PM; transfer to hotel", "Yatra RFID registration", "Dinner at hotel"], "time": "6:00 AM"}, {"dayNumber": 2, "title": "Yatra to Bhawan", "description": "Start early from Banganga for the 13 km walk to the Bhawan for Mata''s darshan, then on to Bhairon Baba temple. Return to Katra by night.", "activityDetails": ["Start from Banganga around 5:00 AM", "Darshan at the Holy Cave (Bhawan)", "Bhairon Baba temple (ropeway optional, own cost)", "Return walk / pony to Katra", "Breakfast & dinner at hotel"], "time": "5:00 AM"}, {"dayNumber": 3, "title": "Rest day & Katra local", "description": "A slow day after the climb. Optional half-day to Shiv Khori or Jhajjar Kotli (cab at own cost), or rest and shop for prasad and dry fruits.", "activityDetails": ["Late breakfast", "Optional: Shiv Khori cave temple (about 80 km)", "Katra market for prasad & dry fruits", "Dinner at hotel"]}, {"dayNumber": 4, "title": "Katra → New Delhi by Vande Bharat", "description": "Check out and board the afternoon Vande Bharat back to New Delhi, reaching late night.", "activityDetails": ["Check out after breakfast", "Transfer to Katra station", "Vande Bharat, AC Chair Car — snacks & dinner on board", "Arrive New Delhi around 11:00 PM"], "time": "3:00 PM"}]','[{"id": "vai-261124", "startDate": "2026-11-24", "startTime": "06:00", "endDate": "2026-11-27", "endTime": "23:00", "seats": 20, "price": null, "status": "open", "note": ""}, {"id": "vai-261208", "startDate": "2026-12-