('ujjain-mahakal-omkareshwar-ex-delhi-5d','Ujjain Mahakal & Omkareshwar · Ex Delhi','Two Jyotirlingas in one trip — Mahakaleshwar in Ujjain and Omkareshwar on the Narmada, with Indore''s Sarafa night market. Overnight train in 3AC from Delhi.','Board an overnight train from Delhi and wake up in Ujjain. Darshan at Mahakaleshwar, the Mahakal Lok corridor, Harsiddhi and Kaal Bhairav, evening aarti at Ram Ghat on the Shipra; the next day Omkareshwar and Mamleshwar on the Narmada, then Indore''s Khajrana Ganesh and Sarafa before the train home.

## Good to know
- Bhasma Aarti passes are issued only by the temple trust (online or limited offline quota). We help you apply but cannot guarantee them; they are not part of the price.
- Train: overnight 3AC in both directions on a direct Delhi–Ujjain/Indore train, booked by us in your names (ID needed at booking). Berths are allotted by IRCTC.
- Prices include 5% GST.',5,4,'["Delhi", "Ujjain", "Omkareshwar", "Indore"]','["pilgrimage", "budget", "family"]','[{"dayNumber": 1, "title": "Delhi → Ujjain (overnight train)", "description": "Board the evening train from Delhi in 3AC. Dinner on your own.", "activityDetails": ["Report at the Delhi station in the ticket by 6:30 PM", "Overnight 3AC berth"], "time": "7:00 PM"}, {"dayNumber": 2, "title": "Mahakal darshan", "description": "Arrive Ujjain in the morning and check in. Mahakaleshwar Jyotirlinga darshan, the Mahakal Lok corridor, Harsiddhi Mata and Kaal Bhairav temples, and the evening aarti at Ram Ghat.", "activityDetails": ["Station pickup & hotel check-in", "Mahakaleshwar darshan", "Mahakal Lok corridor", "Harsiddhi Mata & Kaal Bhairav", "Shipra aarti at Ram Ghat", "Dinner at hotel"], "time": "9:00 AM"}, {"dayNumber": 3, "title": "Omkareshwar Jyotirlinga", "description": "Drive to Omkareshwar (about 140 km). Darshan at Omkareshwar and Mamleshwar, a boat on the Narmada around the Om-shaped island, and the evening Narmada aarti.", "activityDetails": ["Omkareshwar darshan via the hanging bridge", "Mamleshwar Jyotirlinga", "Narmada boat ride (own cost)", "Overnight in Omkareshwar", "Breakfast & dinner at hotel"], "time": "7:30 AM"}, {"dayNumber": 4, "title": "Indore → Delhi (overnight train)", "description": "Drive to Indore (about 80 km). Khajrana Ganesh temple, Rajwada, and dinner at the Sarafa night market before the night train to Delhi.", "activityDetails": ["Khajrana Ganesh temple", "Rajwada palace (outside view)", "Sarafa Bazaar street food (own cost)", "Board the night train in 3AC"], "time": "8:00 AM"}, {"dayNumber": 5, "title": "Arrive Delhi", "description": "Reach Delhi in the morning/afternoon depending on the train.", "activityDetails": ["Arrive Delhi; tour ends"]}]','[{"id": "ujj-261125", "startDate": "2026-11-25", "startTime": "19:00", "endDate": "2026-11-29", "endTime": "12:00", "seats": 16, "price": null, "status": "open", "note": ""}, {"id":