('kashi-prayagraj-ayodhya-ex-delhi-5d','Kashi, Prayagraj & Ayodhya · Ex Delhi','Kashi Vishwanath and the Ganga aarti, the Sangam at Prayagraj and Shri Ram Janmabhoomi in Ayodhya — 5 days, Vande Bharat from Delhi.','Take the Vande Bharat to Varanasi and spend two nights by the ghats: the evening Ganga aarti at Dashashwamedh, a sunrise boat ride, Kashi Vishwanath and Sarnath. Then the Triveni Sangam at Prayagraj, and two days in Ayodhya for the Ram Mandir, Hanuman Garhi and the Saryu aarti, before the train home.

## Good to know
- Phones, bags and electronics are not allowed inside Kashi Vishwanath or the Ram Mandir; lockers are available at the gates.
- Train: AC Chair Car on Vande Bharat to Varanasi, and an AC chair car / 3AC train from Ayodhya back to Delhi. Timings follow the IRCTC schedule.
- Prices include 5% GST.',5,4,'["New Delhi", "Varanasi", "Sarnath", "Prayagraj", "Ayodhya"]','["pilgrimage", "heritage", "family"]','[{"dayNumber": 1, "title": "New Delhi → Varanasi by Vande Bharat", "description": "Morning Vande Bharat to Varanasi (about 8 hrs). Check in near the ghats and watch the Ganga aarti at Dashashwamedh Ghat.", "activityDetails": ["Report at New Delhi station by 5:30 AM", "Vande Bharat, AC Chair Car — meals on board", "Arrive Varanasi around 2:00 PM", "Ganga aarti at Dashashwamedh Ghat", "Dinner at hotel"], "time": "6:00 AM"}, {"dayNumber": 2, "title": "Kashi darshan & Sarnath", "description": "Sunrise boat ride past the 84 ghats, Kashi Vishwanath darshan via the corridor, Kaal Bhairav and Sankat Mochan, then Sarnath in the afternoon.", "activityDetails": ["Sunrise boat ride (included)", "Kashi Vishwanath darshan", "Kaal Bhairav & Sankat Mochan", "Sarnath: Dhamek Stupa & museum", "Breakfast & dinner at hotel"], "time": "5:30 AM"}, {"dayNumber": 3, "title": "Prayagraj Sangam → Ayodhya", "description": "Drive to Prayagraj (about 120 km) for a boat to the Triveni Sangam and the Bade Hanuman temple, then on to Ayodhya (about 170 km).", "activityDetails": ["Triveni Sangam boat & snan", "Bade (Lete) Hanuman temple", "Drive to Ayodhya, check in by evening", "Breakfast & dinner"], "time": "7:00 AM"}, {"dayNumber": 4, "title": "Ayodhya darshan", "description": "Shri Ram Janmabhoomi Mandir darshan, Hanuman Garhi, Kanak Bhawan and Dashrath Mahal, and the evening aarti at Ram ki Paidi on the Saryu.", "activityDetails": ["Ram Mandir darshan (morning slot)", "Hanuman Garhi", "Kanak Bhawan & Dashrath Mahal", "Saryu aarti at Ram ki Paidi", "Breakfast & dinner at hotel"], "time": "6:30 AM"}, {"dayNumber": 5, "title": "Ayodhya → Delhi", "description": "Check out and board the train from Ayodhya Dham to Delhi.", "activityDetails": ["Check out after breakfast", "Transfer to Ayodhya Dham station", "Train to Delhi, AC Chair Car / 3AC", "Tour ends on arrival in D